sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as ASP.NET Core API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant AI as Python AI Service
    participant Graph as LangGraph

    User->>API: Request new analysis
    API->>DB: Load session/short-term/long-term memory
    DB-->>API: Relevant memory
    API->>AI: AnalysisRequest + memory context
    AI->>Graph: Run workflow
    Graph-->>AI: Analysis + observations
    AI-->>API: Structured result
    API->>DB: Persist new analysis and selected memory
    DB-->>API: Stored
    API-->>User: Result available
